# Codex workspace note

Preferred working directory: `project/` after running `./start.sh`.

Before generating code, read:

1. `../README.md`
2. `../method/index.md`
3. `../method/rules/`
4. `ideas/`
5. `decisions/`
6. `spec/`
7. `checks/acceptance-checklist.md`
8. `prompts/01-generate-code-from-spec.prompt.md`

Generate implementation code only from the accepted spec.
Do not create functionality listed as out of scope or non-goals.
Every generated file must be traceable to the spec.
